"Accessibility permission is missing" = "缺少辅助功能权限";
"Without it, zone clicks and scrolling don’t work. Turn it on for CentralClic in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility. If it already appears on, remove it with “–” and add it again: after an update, macOS may see the app as a different one." = "没有该权限，分区点按和滚动将无法工作。请在“系统设置”→“隐私与安全性”→“辅助功能”中为 CentralClic 打开它。如果它已显示为打开，请用“–”将其移除后重新添加：更新后，macOS 可能会把该 App 视为另一个 App。";
