"Put your fingers on the mouse and click to try it." = "将手指放在鼠标上并点按试试。";
"The mouse surface is split into three strips. The button depends on where your finger is when you press. If there are fingers in several strips, the leftmost one wins (like macOS does with right-click)." = "鼠标表面分为三个区域。按下时手指所在的位置决定是哪个按钮。如果多个区域都有手指，则以最左边的区域为准（与 macOS 的右键点按方式相同）。";
"Click zones" = "点按区域";
"The middle zone takes the rest. The left zone never goes below %ld%% so you can always click normally. You can also drag the lines on the mouse." = "中间区域占据其余部分。左侧区域永远不会小于 %ld%%，这样你始终可以正常点按。你也可以拖移鼠标上的分隔线。";
"Reset" = "重置";
"Pointer speed" = "指针速度";
"System Settings goes up to %@; here you can go further." = "“系统设置”最高只到 %@；在这里可以设得更高。";
"Turn off pointer acceleration" = "关闭指针加速";
"Without acceleration, the pointer always moves the same distance for each centimeter you move the mouse, fast or slow. The speed above still applies." = "关闭加速后，无论移动快慢，鼠标每移动一厘米，指针都移动相同的距离。上面的速度仍然有效。";
"Scrolling speed" = "滚动速度";
